WEBVTT

00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:05.270
Thousands of verified questions, aligned to
the syllabus.

00:00:05.270 --> 00:00:11.610
And when you've worked through them, more —
each one through four stages of validation.

00:00:12.160 --> 00:00:15.080
Timed quizzes, when you have twenty minutes.

00:00:15.080 --> 00:00:18.780
Full mock exams, when you're ready for the
real length.

00:00:19.330 --> 00:00:22.630
Every answer comes with the explanation.

00:00:22.630 --> 00:00:29.130
And on any question, help on that question —
not a search box.

00:00:29.680 --> 00:00:33.780
Chat with your AI Coach, or call it and keep
walking.

00:00:33.780 --> 00:00:38.460
It reads your screen, so you never describe
what you're looking at.

00:00:39.010 --> 00:00:41.110
Study rooms with your cohort, live.

00:00:41.110 --> 00:00:45.900
And your notes in the same place as the
questions that prompted them.

00:00:46.450 --> 00:00:51.560
Analytics that stay on what matters.

00:00:51.560 --> 00:00:52.590
Certuvo finds the gap you keep falling into,
and says so.

00:00:53.140 --> 00:00:56.880
Progress you can see. Streaks that keep you
honest.

00:00:56.880 --> 00:00:59.230
One platform. Certuvo.
